WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.520
when he said what platoon he was with.

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:05.460
And it was exposed that somebody was watching

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:06.880
from that particular platoon.

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:09.120
They said he was never with us.

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:10.720
And then he went out and he cried

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:13.040
and he was ready to drop out of the election.

